      "content": "it's just... it's not just today. it's everything. everything feels like one big wall. you try to do everything right, you follow the rules, you play by the book, and the book just gets thrown in the trash. it feels like there's no point in fighting a machine that doesn't even have a heart. like why even try to stay in a world that's clearly just waiting for you to fail?",
